This is a working _non released_ door that plays just about the _worst_
version of Space Invaders you've ever seen.  Of all the doors/utes I
wrote, this is by far the one that most users used...bloody typical.

Seriously this one has got some scope for expansion, and it would probably
be fun to play.  It needs more invaders, score keeping, high scores,
sound effects ;-], etc, etc.

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   A      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:Crap_Invaders/Crap_Invaders


Ari...